# Local Arrow/HuggingFace datasets built by ../scripts/prep_*.py. Not committed:
# rebuild them with those scripts. See docs/DATASETS.md.
# NO trailing slash: "conservation_flip/" matches a directory but NOT a symlink, so a
# local absolute-path symlink at that name slipped past this file and was committed in
